    "long_instructions": "### Use AI like a Graphic Designer\r\n1. Type your theme, audience, and colors of your project into the chat.\r\n\r\n2. Ask the AI to make an image that fits your guide.\r\n3. Try different prompts & compare results. \r\n4. Save an image you like to the backpack for your project. \r\n\r\n>**Use your prompting strategy:** Include a goal, context, and details.\r\n>\r\n>*For example:* `The theme of the guide is basketball and it is for middle school athletes using orange and black colors to match the bobcat team mascot. Make a new logo for the team.`",
